  "description": "Installation of a bespoke timber flood gate within an existing opening in the rear flood defence wall at 42 Twickenham Road, Teddington. The gate will reinstate a continuous flood defence barrier while maintaining access between the patio and the lower garden.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "It is not possible to tell from the submission materials where the proposed gate will be located. We require existing and proposed site plans which make this clear. Scale bars also required to submitted plans. Existing and proposed elevations also do not seem relevant to each other - they will need to be amended to tally with one another."
